# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated simulation vectors.
# Every .hex and expected-*.txt is produced by the matching
# testbenches/*_generator.py, roughly 78 MB in total. The generators are
# tracked, their output is not. See README.md, section "Simulation".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.hex
testbenches/*expected*.txt

# Python
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ModelSim / QuestaSim, in case you simulate inside the working copy.
# These files carry absolute local paths and must not be committed.
work/
transcript
*.wlf
*.mti
*.mpf
modelsim.ini
.library_mapping.xml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vivado.
# vivado/ holds only the non-regenerable project sources. Everything a build
# produces stays out, including an exported Archive Project directory, which is
# ~490 MB of checkpoints and carries a second copy of src/ that goes stale.
#
# Rebuilding also drops output beside the referenced block design, inside
# vivado/ itself. See README.md, section "vivado/".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vivado-HW-Acc.xpr/
vivado/HW_Acc.bda
vivado/ip/
*.runs/
*.gen/
*.cache/
*.ip_user_files/
*.sim/
*.hw/
*.ipdefs/
*.dcp
*.bit
*.bit.bin*
*.xsa
*.rpx
.Xil/
*.jou
vivado*.log

# Device-tree build output (compiled from deploy/HW_Acc.dts)
*.dtbo

# Editor and OS noise
*.bak
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
